00:39:45,694 --> 00:39:46,736
My phone died.

566
00:39:49,656 --> 00:39:50,532
Thank you.

567
00:40:02,502 --> 00:40:04,880
Come on! Of all times,
Zeke had to be on a long call.

568
00:40:08,216 --> 00:40:09,009
Thanks.

569
00:40:13,722 --> 00:40:14,764
Hey!

570
00:40:16,148 --> 00:40:17,149
Oh my god!

571
00:40:18,268 --> 00:40:19,561
Are we playing?

572
00:40:19,895 --> 00:40:20,478
Why?

573
00:40:20,478 --> 00:40:21,771
You wanna play?

574
00:40:22,230 --> 00:40:23,084
Sure!

575
00:40:23,940 --> 00:40:25,442
Let's do it!

576
00:40:25,442 --> 00:40:26,484
But,

577
00:40:26,693 --> 00:40:28,570
let's add a plot twist.

578
00:40:28,904 --> 00:40:29,694
Deal?

579
00:40:30,197 --> 00:40:31,448
Someone dies.

580
00:40:32,324 --> 00:40:33,033
Hey!

581
00:40:33,033 --> 00:40:36,369
That's like those movies
where the main character dies.

582
00:40:37,787 --> 00:40:38,914
I don't wanna die yet.

583
00:40:40,207 --> 00:40:43,418
That would've been nice,
but that's not how this goes.

584
00:40:43,668 --> 00:40:44,711
You're not dying yet.

585
00:40:44,878 --> 00:40:45,587
Okay.

586
00:40:45,587 --> 00:40:46,420
Here's how it works.

587
00:40:46,922 --> 00:40:49,049
I'll give each of us five cards.

588
00:40:49,049 --> 00:40:52,385
Whoever wins gets to
ask anything they want.

589
00:40:52,552 --> 00:40:53,178
Oh, I get it.

590
00:40:53,303 --> 00:40:55,013
Like truth or consequence?

591
00:40:55,013 --> 00:40:56,139
Exactly!

592
00:40:57,057 --> 00:40:58,001
So?

593
00:40:58,308 --> 00:40:59,034
You in?

594
00:40:59,059 --> 00:41:00,048
Sure, let's play!

595
00:41:08,612 --> 00:41:09,525
Did you get it?

596
00:41:10,070 --> 00:41:11,197
Fuck, bro.

597
00:41:11,279 --> 00:41:12,322
Don't you have any faith in me?

598
00:41:15,492 --> 00:41:16,283
Guess what?

599
00:41:16,868 --> 00:41:18,620
It's the blueprint of
Roswell Corporation.

600
00:41:19,704 --> 00:41:21,081
But what I don't get is,

601
00:41:22,415 --> 00:41:23,917
how did they get a copy of this?

602
00:41:24,834 --> 00:41:25,877
I don't know either, bro.

603
00:41:27,003 --> 00:41:27,931
But the question is,

604
00:41:28,463 --> 00:41:29,673
who'd they get it from?

605
00:41:32,008 --> 00:41:32,931
Fiona?

606
00:41:35,553 --> 00:41:36,680
I don't know either, bro.

607
00:41:37,555 --> 00:41:39,516
Maybe we should just
take this to boss.

608
00:41:46,481 --> 00:41:47,376
Bro!

609
00:41:48,024 --> 00:41:49,359
What, already missing
this handsome face?

610
00:41:49,690 --> 00:41:52,819
Idiot! Aemie's missing.
Boss is losing it!

611
00:41:53,947 --> 00:41:54,814
Damn!

612
00:41:55,115 --> 00:41:58,451
Damn right! We're
gonna feel boss's wrath

613
00:41:58,451 --> 00:42:00,954
if we don't find
Aemie. So get moving!

614
00:42:01,746 --> 00:42:02,789
Fuck.

615
00:42:05,166 --> 00:42:06,173
Shit.

616
00:42:06,293 --> 00:42:07,298
Let's go.

617
00:42:10,088 --> 00:42:11,214
Where do you think she went?

618
00:42:11,881 --> 00:42:13,008
I don't know either.

619
00:42:16,636 --> 00:42:17,642
Whoa!

620
00:42:18,138 --> 00:42:19,347
That's so unfair!

621
00:42:19,347 --> 00:42:21,057
I keep losing. I don't wanna play anymore.

622
00:42:21,057 --> 00:42:23,268
Sorry, rules are rules.

623
00:42:23,435 --> 00:42:25,562
So, for your last question,

624
00:42:26,146 --> 00:42:28,231
answer this honestly so

625
00:42:28,440 --> 00:42:29,357
you can go home.

626
00:42:30,025 --> 00:42:30,900
Okay, sure.

627
00:42:33,194 --> 00:42:38,244
What was Roswell's
last order to his men?

628
00:42:42,448 --> 00:42:44,597
These people are so weird.

629
00:42:44,622 --> 00:42:46,416
First they asked about Moo.

630
00:42:46,875 --> 00:42:48,501
Then it was about Mom.

631
00:42:48,626 --> 00:42:50,295
And now it's about Zeke?

632
00:42:52,672 --> 00:42:53,673
Wait.

633
00:42:54,466 --> 00:42:56,092
Could this be a test?

634
00:42:57,510 --> 00:42:59,721
Oh. Then I better answer well.

635
00:43:02,390 --> 00:43:03,236
Uhh.

636
00:43:04,184 --> 00:43:07,245
He told Kaizer to keep an eye on Yaji.

637
00:43:07,270 --> 00:43:10,815
Then Vash was
assigned to watch Mom.

638
00:43:11,024 --> 00:43:14,361
Then Sebastian was sent
to investigate a Mafia group.

639
00:43:14,569 --> 00:43:17,614
Then Jacob was assigned
to the guardian angel.

640
00:43:21,368 --> 00:43:22,744
Why are you laughing?

641
00:43:22,744 --> 00:43:23,828
No, I'm serious.

642
00:43:23,828 --> 00:43:25,205
I'm not kidding.

643
00:43:25,230 --> 00:43:26,151
Yeah.

644
00:43:26,373 --> 00:43:27,916
We know you're not kidding.

645
00:43:28,625 --> 00:43:31,419
That's why we're taking you home.

646
00:43:32,337 --> 00:43:33,338
Just show us where you live.

647
00:43:34,297 --> 00:43:36,257
But, Aemie,

648
00:43:37,140 --> 00:43:40,185
can you not mention
us to Roswell?

649
00:43:41,054 --> 00:43:42,555
Our names.

650
00:43:43,348 --> 00:43:46,309
And what we talked about.

651
00:43:48,228 --> 00:43:49,813
Wow.

652
00:43:49,813 --> 00:43:51,689
What do you take me for, a gossip?

653
00:43:52,357 --> 00:43:54,442
Of course I won't tell him.

654
00:43:54,442 --> 00:43:56,444
You're so judgmental.

655
00:43:57,445 --> 00:43:59,656
But what if he asks?

656
00:44:00,865 --> 00:44:04,119
We have a surprise for Mr. Roswell.

657
00:44:04,369 --> 00:44:07,163
So it has to stay a secret.

658
00:44:07,455 --> 00:44:08,623
- Oh!
- Secret.

659
00:44:08,748 --> 00:44:10,333
A surprise? Okay, okay, okay.

660
00:44:10,333 --> 00:44:11,251
I won't tell him.

661
00:44:11,251 --> 00:44:12,127
Our little secret.

662
00:44:12,127 --> 00:44:13,086
Just between us.

663
00:44:19,050 --> 00:44:20,260
Can I take this home?

664
00:44:21,344 --> 00:44:22,275
Aemie!

665
00:44:23,346 --> 00:44:24,139
Aemie!

666
00:44:25,640 --> 00:44:26,433
Aemie!

667
00:44:31,104 --> 00:44:32,001
Boss!

668
00:44:32,272 --> 00:44:33,212
Boss!

669
00:44:33,857 --> 00:44:34,983
I've already sent everyone out.

670
00:44:35,442 --> 00:44:36,526
They're searching for her now.

671
00:44:37,026 --> 00:44:37,798
Okay?

672
00:44:39,612 --> 00:44:40,363
Fuck!

673
00:44:44,617 --> 00:44:45,572
Hey!

674
00:44:46,661 --> 00:44:47,954
Zeke, why do you have this?

675
00:44:49,038 --> 00:44:50,081
I gave this to—

676
00:44:50,790 --> 00:44:51,798
Who's that?

677
00:44:52,959 --> 00:44:54,127
Must've followed you here.

678
00:44:54,252 --> 00:44:55,345
Are you stupid?

679
00:44:56,337 --> 00:44:57,797
What if Roswell finds out?

680
00:44:58,006 --> 00:45:00,800
My friends at Stonehurst?
Don't you know them?

681
00:45:00,967 --> 00:45:03,219
Ezekiel, I brought you some lunch.

682
00:45:03,928 --> 00:45:06,389
From a very fancy restaurant.

683
00:45:06,414 --> 00:45:07,915
My wife bought our lunch.

684
00:45:09,184 --> 00:45:09,934
Right wife?

685
00:45:10,935 --> 00:45:12,395
Uh, yes, hubby.

686
00:45:12,479 --> 00:45:14,230
Allow me to present,

687
00:45:14,647 --> 00:45:16,399
our artisanal

688
00:45:16,733 --> 00:45:19,527
handheld beef creation.

689
00:45:19,569 --> 00:45:20,814
Fast-food lang yan!

690
00:45:20,945 --> 00:45:21,696
Want a bite?

691
00:45:21,696 --> 00:45:23,114
I want nothing...

692
00:45:23,490 --> 00:45:24,908
but your husband.

693
00:45:24,908 --> 00:45:26,326
And sooner or later...

694
00:45:26,951 --> 00:45:28,411
he will be mine.

695
00:45:30,163 --> 00:45:31,623
So keep that in mind,

696
00:45:32,457 --> 00:45:33,500
Aemie.
